<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n60339" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κτηδών</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όνος</span>, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>line
				of fissure</i> in the fibre of wood, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				5.1.9
			</span></i> sq.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κτηδόνες ξύλου</span>
			<i>grain</i> of wood, <i><span class="en">
				Hero
				<u>Bel.</u>
				96.12
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> Medic. in pl., <i>fibres
				of the heart</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Cord.</u>
				10
			</span></i>, cf. Erot.
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἶνες</span>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>layers</i> in the cornea of the eye, <i><span class="en">
				Ruf.
				<u>Anat.</u>
				10
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>c.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. πιμελῆς</span>
			<i>fibres</i> in a piece of fat, <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				1.118
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>layers</i> of slate, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				5.127
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>gills</i> of a mushroom, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				3.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>5.</b>
			<i>shreds</i> of lint, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				8.415
			</span></i>. (Cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐκτέανος</span> (B),
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐθυκτέανον,
		ἰθυκτέανον</span>.)</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
